Usage: agent-deck session show [id|title] [options]

Show session details. If no ID is provided, auto-detects current session.
Account: shows the quoted stored account slot, not a resolved account or login identity.
JSON always includes the raw "account" string, including "" when no slot is stored.

Options:
  -json
    	Output as JSON
  -q	Minimal output (short)
  -queue-full
    	With --json, list every queued send instead of the newest 100 (see 'session queue list')
  -quiet
    	Minimal output
